# V2-12 the Neolithic (docs/design/neolithic.md): in the Mediterranean scrub of the Standard
# planet of seed 11, early summer. The wild mouflon beside the sheep a herder's line became (a
# bred fleece, cream); a field of einkorn on tilled plots, ripe and green, by a saddle quern, a
# storage pit and the wild stand; the crafts' stations — a warp-weighted loom, a potter's wheel, an
# updraft kiln — and a ewe tethered at her stake.
# `hearth --screenshot-list tools/shots/v212_neolithic.shots`
defaults: seed=11, planet=standard, res=256, w=960, h=540, hour=10, clouds=0.25, dry=true, biome=mediterranean_scrub, season=summer@0.2
